  "long_description": "This Rhino Rack rack package includes everything you need to fit securely to your Toyota Hilux N80 4dr Ute (2015 to 2026) with Bare Roof. Rhino Rack 62100 Platform: the Rhino-Rack 6 Series Pioneer Platform delivers a strong, lightweight, and highly versatile roof cargo solution designed for touring, work, and everyday transport. Engineered using advanced materials and an aerodynamic design, it helps reduce wind drag and noise while maintaining exceptional durability. Low-profile design keeps the load close to the roofline for improved stability. Integrated wiring capabilities allow clean installation of lighting and electrical accessories. Rhino Rack RTHB1 Platform Backbone: made from non-corrosive stainless steel, suits Pioneer Platform 52100 for both N70 & N80 Hilux, requires mounting to a Rhino-Rack RTS track set. System weight 23.7kg, 1-hour installation time. Rhino Rack RTS556 Tracks: designed specifically for the Toyota Hilux Double Cab (2015-Current), providing a secure and reliable base for mounting roof rack components.",
